# Low-Code Admin Rules

## Objective
Generate admin management interfaces from schemas and configuration rather than hand-building every page.

## Required patterns

- schema-driven forms
- schema-driven tables
- schema-driven filters
- schema-driven actions
- schema-driven detail panels

## Admin page generation rule

Every admin entity page must be describable with:

- fields
- columns
- validation rules
- actions
- filters
- permissions
- API mapping

## Forbidden

- duplicate page logic
- page-specific business rules that belong to service layer
- hardcoded table and form layouts when schema is sufficient
